  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in the bottom of a large clay or ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook, stirring occasionally, for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the beef and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the onions, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper. Cook, stirring occasionally, for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the apricots and 2 cups of water. Bring to a boil, then cover and simmer for 1 1/2 hours, or until the beef is tender.",
